{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03792","headline":"泛舟送郑卿入京 · 杜审言","name":"泛舟送郑卿入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝坐蓬莱殿，恩追社稷臣。\n长安遥向日，宗伯正乘春。\n相宅开基地，倾都送别人。\n行舟萦渌水，列戟满红尘。\n酒助欢娱洽，风催景气新。\n此时光乃命，谁爲惜无津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}